Revision history for Discord-Client

0.003  2026-11-21
    Improve replay cleanup performance for interaction delivery.
    Use monotonic integration watchdogs to avoid clock-correction failures.
    Replace cached channel data when its obfuscation state changes.

0.002  2026-11-07
    Fix a Future::XS crash when cancelling chained REST requests.
    Stabilize HTTP and Gateway integration tests and bound asynchronous waits.
    Test both Future::XS and pure Perl implementations in CI.
    Add author contact details to distribution metadata.

0.001  2026-11-04
    Initial release
